        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present 4 Ashfield, Templeogue, Dublin 6W to the market a superb four bedroom, three bathroom detached family home extending to approximately c. 132 sq.m of bright and well-proportioned living accommodation. Nestled within the highly sought-after Ashfield development, this wonderful home enjoys a peaceful residential setting while benefiting from every conceivable amenity close at hand.\r\n \r\nTempleogue Village, Terenure and Rathfarnham are all within easy reach, offering an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, supermarkets and local shops. Bushy Park is just a short distance away, while a range of sports clubs and leisure facilities are nearby. The area is also renowned for its selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, making it an exceptional choice for growing families. Excellent public transport links and convenient access to the M50 further enhance this prime location.\r\n\r\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, generous living room, dining area, sitting room, fully fitted kitchen, and guest wc on the ground floor. Upstairs hosts four well-proportioned bedrooms including a master ensuite, together with a main family bathroom. The well-balanced layout offers excellent versatility and is perfectly suited to modern family living.\r\n\r\nExternally, No. 4 boasts a private driveway to the front providing ample off-street parking, while to the rear is a wonderful south west facing garden enjoying sunshine throughout the afternoon and evening. A block-built shed to the rear is currently being used as a utility room and additional storage space, however, it also offers excellent potential to be converted into a home office or gym.\r\n\r\nComing to the market with the added benefit of no onward chain, No. 4 presents a fantastic opportunity for families seeking a detached home in one of Templeogue's most desirable residential developments. Combining generous accommodation, a prime location and outstanding potential, this is a property that is sure to generate significant interest. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n• c. 132 sqm\r\n• BER E \r\n• 4 Bed / 3 Bath\r\n• Detached home \r\n• Driveway \r\n• Gas heating\r\n• Double glazed windows\r\n• Fully fitted kitchen \r\n• Sunny south west rear garden in lawn \r\n• Block built shed to the rear\r\n• Bright and airy\r\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout \r\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\r\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance \r\n• Highly sought after location \r\n• Ideal for growing families \r\n• No onwards chain \r\n• Viewing highly advised!\r\n\r\nDirections;\r\nEircode: D6WEY06"
      },
